# Schneekugel: a rolling snow globe from the souvenir stand. Pale glass dome
# h with s reflections on its bottom-right, a w glint that stays top-left,
# a tiny white Roessl horse w/i inside and snow flecks w that move between
# frames; a wooden base O/l that turns with the roll (rolling left = counter-
# clockwise: bottom, right, top, left). Pale blue-white and brown, never gold
# and round (not an Oblate, not a Mozartkugel). Drafted with a scratch script
# (circle + base cap + automatic k outline), then frozen to text here.
sprite = schneekugel
size   = 12x12
origin = 6,11
hitbox = 1,1,10,10
anim   = roll frames=4 ticks=6 loop
